Package: faz-agora
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, python3-pyqt6
Description: task manager with optional WebDAV synchronization
 Faz agora! organizes tasks, subtasks, recurring tasks, and reminders.
 It works offline and can optionally synchronize data through a WebDAV server
 chosen by the user.
